  ✓ Stage 2: establish contract, regenerate MPython, and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Stage 3: cleanly rebuild semantics/proof and execute concrete/proof targets
  ✓ Stage 4: analyze claim adequacy and real-program pinning with satisfying witnesses
  → Stage 5: inventory and audit every K declaration/rule for soundness
  • Stage 6: create and run a fresh false-postcondition non-vacuity mutation
  • Stage 7: account for proven versus assumed facts and write final REVIEW.md
